{"action": "patch", "name": "single-file-html-dev", "old_string": "## Online Asset Strategy (QQ Group Sharing)", "new_string": "## Image Loading Optimization (Shimmer Skeleton + Fade-in)

When loading remote images (VNDB CDN, etc.) over slow connections, improve perceived performance:

### CSS Setup
```css
.gci{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1030,#2a1845)} /* placeholder color */

/* Shimmer sweep overlay */
.gci::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(110deg,transparent 30%,rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 50%,transparent 70%);
  background-size:200% 100%;animation:shimmer 1.8s infinite;pointer-events:none;z-index:1}
@keyframes shimmer{0%{background-position:200% 0}100%{background-position:-200% 0}}

/* Hidden until loaded, then fade in */
.gci img{opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.6s ease;position:relative;z-index:2}
.gci img.loaded{opacity:1}

/* Remove shimmer on load */
.gci.loaded::after{opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.5s}
```

### JS Handler (on each `<img>`)
```html
<img ... loading="lazy"
  onload="this.classList.add('loaded');this.parentElement.classList.add('loaded')"
  onerror="this.style.display='none';this.parentElement.style.background='...'">
```

### Key Points
- **Shimmer direction**: `110deg` diagonal sweep, `background-size:200%` moves from `200% → -200%`
- **Opacity hidden by default** — no flash of blank white
- **`.loaded` class cascades** — removes shimmer + fades in image simultaneously
- **Already has `loading="lazy"`** — reduces concurrent requests for offscreen images
- **`onerror` still fires** — shows a gradient placeholder if VNDB is unreachable

## Online Asset Strategy (QQ Group Sharing)"}
